.# A Group with parameters
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<div data-xwiki-group class="box infomessage">

hello **world**

* item

</div>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|event/1.0
.#-----------------------------------------------------
beginDocument
beginGroup [[class]=[box infomessage]]
beginParagraph
onWord [hello]
onSpace
beginFormat [BOLD]
onWord [world]
endFormat [BOLD]
endParagraph
beginList [BULLETED]
beginListItem
onWord [item]
endListItem
endList [BULLETED]
endGroup [[class]=[box infomessage]]
endDocument
